00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:12.600
Hey, everyone.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.810
I'm here with Louise Byrne,
head of training delivery

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:16.070
at Google Cloud.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.590
Last week, Google announced
a new collaboration

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:20.930
with Coursera, an online
learning platform,

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.800
which sounds pretty exciting.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.500
So before we get
started, can you

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.840
tell us more about
how this addresses

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:29.629
some of the technical
skills gap around the cloud?

00:06:29.629 --> 00:06:30.920
LOUISE BYRNE: Yeah, definitely.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:33.410
We're obviously hugely excited
to have this collaboration

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:34.760
with Coursera.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.550
And one of the things that
we have heard consistently

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:41.510
from our customers, from
partners, from developers,

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:44.600
as well as what recent
research has also shown,

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:48.260
is that one of the biggest
challenges for organizations

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:52.370
and individuals to move and
take advantage of Cloud products

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.950
in general is skills gaps.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.260
It has been cited as
the number one concern

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:01.550
that companies have in
moving to the cloud.

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:03.950
We believe that our
investment in training,

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:07.160
and more specifically this
collaboration with Coursera,

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:12.230
will enable us to help
close this skills gap.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:15.310
By working with Coursera,
what it enables us to do

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.380
is provide training in
an on-demand format that

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:22.400
can be consumed by anyone
anywhere in the world

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.770
and in a time frame
that works for them.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.030
DREA ALPHONSO: Right.

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:27.650
