00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.860
LOUISE BYRNE: Yeah, so
we're really excited, again,

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.260
with Coursera because
it's timed with also

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:40.895
the launch of some new training
that we have around big data

00:07:40.895 --> 00:07:42.320
and machine learning.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:44.030
Huge amount of
interest, obviously,

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.520
in the whole area
of machine learning,

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:49.980
and so we have that, which is,
just in general, a new course.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:53.240
We're adding that to
Coursera from the get-go.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:57.885
And we also have our Systems
Operations Course up there,

00:07:57.885 --> 00:08:03.290
a specialization
around SysOps, which

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:07.100
is the course that maps
to the infrastructure

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:11.310
kind of focus of the Google
Cloud Platform products.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.192
And there is many
more courses to come.

00:08:14.192 --> 00:08:15.650
So watch this space
over the coming

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:18.150
months for the other courses
that are coming down the line.

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:18.620
DREA ALPHONSO: So
just when we were

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.930
talking about with
Coursera and now

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:23.540
with our acquisition
of Quiklabs,

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.380
hos do those two
tie in together?

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:26.150
LOUISE BYRNE: Yeah,
I mean, I think

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.470
that they tie in really well.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:30.920
First is, obviously, they
show the commitment and focus

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:33.140
that Google Cloud is
giving to training.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:35.630
And we are taking this
very, very seriously

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.900
in terms of doing whatever we
can to help close this skills

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:42.710
gap and enable people so
that they can take advantage

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.140
of the opportunities that
working with Google Cloud

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:47.270
products can bring.

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:49.340
I think also what
it really shows

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.700
is our learner-first approach.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:56.090
What is wonderful about
the Quiklabs platform

00:08:56.090 --> 00:09:00.080
is that it provides learners
with real lab environments

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.850
