practice whatever

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.430
it is that they have
learned from the courseware,

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.850
from the materials.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:10.640
And they can go in and implement
that in a practice environment,

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:13.550
which is what the labs offer.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.590
Combining that with
the Coursera just

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:18.650
means that you have a
really high quality training

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:21.651
product that can be
consumed anywhere by anyone.

00:09:21.651 --> 00:09:22.650
So, yeah, I think it's--

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:23.290
DREA ALPHONSO: So
a bit of learning,

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.456
a little bit of application.

00:09:24.456 --> 00:09:25.400
LOUISE BYRNE: Exactly.

