00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.910
But talk to us like how this
translates for enterprises

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:32.827
and for businesses.

00:16:32.827 --> 00:16:34.910
KAZ SATO: So actually,
this is a miniature version

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.540
of the real-world use cases.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:40.250
And here we have
all the displays

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:42.270
